"Exclamatory Enterprise. It offers the finest experience in species death and "
"destruction humor. Set the device on its way and at the designated star and "
"the designated time, the star will go nova wreaking hilarious havoc on "
"hapless aliens in the area. You'll get hours of entertainment from copious "
"amounts of death, destruction, maiming and panic - all the hallmarks of the "
"finest amusement available to the Exuari."
msgstr ""
